<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">Iyaa (YAK) NT en Kiyaka</book>
  <para style="h">Mukaanda a Pawuli wa tsiomi kwaa basi Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Te</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaanda a Pawuli wa tsiomi kwaa basi Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukaanda a Pawuli wa tsiomi kwaa basi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili a mukaanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli abali libuundu la ku ngaanda a Tesalonika, mu taanga dia midieenge mia nde mia isala kia Nziaambi mia mbala ya dioolo. Nde ayeni ku ngaanda yii nha mbisi a usiisi ngaanda a Filipi. Ngaanda a Tesalonika yili ku taanda a tsi ya kuumbu Eleene, ku peembi ya Esete, mu itinini kia Masedwane. Tesalonika yili ngaanda yibubaata kaari kwalaa. Bieenyi bialaa bibaadiaala mu ngaanda yii, na vulu-vulu Bayuudayo. Bayuudayo babamosi a bakisiingi pe nziisili a Pawuli, na bo bamubingi mu ngaanda yii. Ka Pawuli asonii kwaa basi Tesalonika boosi, babakiingili mayele mu uduku Yiisu. Mu yii, nde li mu uhama mu uha nziisili a nde. Babayii mandaa ma Biibila bali mu uleele ti, mukaanda wu, li mukaanda watsiomi wu Pawuli asonii kwaa mabuundu moosi. Ni mu buu, nde ali ka mukaanda wavulu bukulu mu mikaanda mia Lilasina li Linyatii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiiti kia tsiomi natee kia bitata (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1-3">1—3</ref></char>) bili mu umweese bisi buli itwaari kia Pawuli na basi Tesalonika. Pawuli ayaki mamvuungu mamabwe ma libuundu la ku ngaanda a Tesalonika. Nde li mu ulibili bo moonyi mu isala ki nde asi kwaa bo. Nde li mu uleele ka bo, mu ki iteesi nde ali na nzala ya ubwamonono na bo. Mu kiiti kia bina na kia bitaana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4-5">4—5</ref></char>), Pawuli li mu uhamisa basi Tesalonika mu ukulu mu idiingi kia bo mu Kristo. Nde li mu uha mamvutu, mu manduru mamali mu uviinzili mitimi mia libuundu lilinyatii. Bangaa Kristo batsiomi, bakikebe ti Kristo ayiri avutuu mawasa. Kaba, balibuundu babamosi bakwiiri, tswaamina Pfumu Yiisu uyiri avutuu. Ni mu buu, bangaa Kristo bali mu ufulusunu manduru mu uyaaba, buni babakwa baa bakaaba. Pawuli li mu uleele ti <char style="em">babakwa na babali moonyi, bo boosi itwaari bali mu Yiisu Kristo</char>. Sa iba na iluumbu ki bo boosi busiimbuu mu likwa. Uli na ndutu mu ukebe iluumbu kia Pfumu Yiisu, ka a uli na muutu pe wayaaba taanga dia iluumbu kii. Ndaa yavulu ndutu, ni uba itwaari na Pfumu, weti bu Pfumu ali mu uloombo.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Me Pawuli, Siila na Timoteo, dili mu usonuu mukaanda wu kwaa libuundu la ku ngaanda a Tesalonika. Lo lili libuundu la Nziaambi Taayi na Pfumu Yiisu Kristo: nyaala bweese na iyeenge biba na beni.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli li mu uvutulu matoondo kwaa Nziaambi mu imiini kia basi Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Taanga dioosi, bisi dili mu ubaavutulu matoondo kwaa Nziaambi mundaa beni boosi, na dili mu ubaalibilanga moonyi mu beni mu makuundu ma bisi. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Mu ngwanya, bisi dili mu ulibili moonyi nha kulu a Taayi a bisi Nziaambi, buni beni dili mu usa bisala mu mukonono mundaa imiini kia beni, mu litoono na ilimbisi kia beni mu Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo nha kulu a Nziaambi a bisi.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Baana ba nguu, bisi diayaaba ti Nziaambi atoono beni na nde asooli beni, paa beni diba baata ba nde. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Mu ngwanya, mu taanga di bisi diayaabisi beni Ndaa Yimbwe, a yali ndila mu bitoolo pe. Ka bisi diayaabisi yo, mu lituu na libaasila la Muheebili wa Ngira na mu ilimbisi kioosi. Beni diayaaba bwali ndiaatili a bisi nha kati a beni, mundaa mbweeyili a beni. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Beni diaduki ifwaani kia bisi na kia Pfumu. So bu beni diali kutso mapasi, beni diayaki Ndaa Nziaambi mu kinyi yili mu umata kwaa Muheebili wa Ngira. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ni mu buu, beni dika ifwaani ki ibwe kwaa bangaa imiini bali mu bitinini bia Masedwane na Akayi. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Mu ngwanya, ubanduu kwa beni, mandaa ma Pfumu Nziaambi a ma yuuyini na tee ku Masedwane na ku Akayi. Ka mvuungu a imiini kia beni mu Pfumu Nziaambi ya yabini mu mabuu moosi. Mu yii bisi a dili na nzala ya utsuu mu yo pe. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Baata boosi bali mu utsuu mundaa nziakili yi beni diayaki bisi, mu taanga di bisi diayiri kwaa beni. Na bo bali mu utsuu ka mu ndaa yi beni diabwoongili biteyi mu ukiinguu kwaa Nziaambi mu usalila nde, nde wuli Nziaambi wa moonyi na wa ngwanya. <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Beni dili mu ukebe ti, Yiisu mwaana nde amata ku mayula. Ni nde Nziaambi asiimbili mu babakwa. Nde li mu ukuulu bisi mu kesi a Nziaambi yika bebele.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Isala kia Pawuli ku ngaanda a Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Baana ba nguu ba me, beni bame diayiluu uyaaba ti, a mu ibuu pe bisi diayiri kwaa beni. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Beni diayaaba ka ti, tsiomi bakituu bisi na bamweesi bisi pasi ku ngaanda a Filipi. Ka Nziaambi aha bisi ibaala kia uyaabisa Ndaa Yimbwe mu ilimbisi kwaa beni, so bu yali ti kutso ndwaanisi.<verse eid="1TH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Mu ngwanya, pamisi yi bisi diayiri beni a yili ya pia pe. Yo a yamata pe mu matsimi ma bisi ma butsa-butsa, na bisi a dili mu ufutu pia kwaa muutu so mosi pe. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Ka Nziaambi amoni ti bisi dili ba kuu, nde aheeri bisi isala kia uyaabisa Ndaa Yimbwe. Bisi a dili mu usaa pe umonuu bababwe nha kulu a baata, ka kwaa Nziaambi wuli mu ukengese mitimi mia bisi. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Beni diayiluu uyaaba ti, bisi a diasialili pe tsuyili ya peluu. Bu mosi ka, bisi a diasalili pe bitoolo mu nzala ya ubaa mboongo! Nziaambi li mbaangi a bisi. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Bisi a diasaa pe mbilili yili mu umatuu kwaa baata, so yaba kwaa beni, so yaba kwaa baata bakimi. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Ka bunu, bisi aba utuu ubamuu beni ku tsini a litumu la bisi, mundaa ti bisi dili batumu ba Kristo! Ka bisi dimweesi buleembi nha kati a beni, weti bu nguu ubaaba na buleembi mu baana ba nde. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Bisi dili na litoono lalaa mu beni, ni mu buu, bisi dili diayilimi a ndila mu uyaabisa beni Ndaa Yimbwe wa Nziaambi pe, ka na uha idiingi kia bisi mu beni, mu ndaa ti beni diaka ba mbayi ba bisi ba litoono. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Baana ba nguu, beni dili mu ulibili moonyi mu mapasi ma bisi diamoni mu isala kia bisi. Bisi diasiali butsuu na nyanga mu unyaala uba mufunu kwaa muutu so ndila mosi mu beni. Ka bunu bisi diakiyiisi beni Ndaa Yimbwe ya Nziaambi. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Beni dili bambaangi ba bisi na Nziaambi: Ndiaatili a bisi nha kati a beni ba ngaa imiini, ya li ya ngiri, wa suungunu na wa buleembi, na yahele na bisieembi. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Beni diayaaba ti bisi diadiaati na mosi mosi mu beni, weti taayi na baana ba nde. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Bisi diahamisi beni na diahi beni mandoongi. Bisi dialoombi kwaa beni mu mukonono mu uba na ndiaatili yi Nziaambi atoono. Nde wuli mu uta beni mbili mu ukoto mu Ipfumu kia nde na mu buzitu ba nde.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Bisi dili mu ubaavutulanga matoondo kwaa Nziaambi mu ndaa ti mu taanga di bisi diayaabisi beni ndaa a Nziaambi, beni diayuyi yo na diayaki yo. Beni a diayaki yo pe weti mandaa mapaamba ma baata bubaa leele, ka weti ndaa a Nziaambi. Mu ngwanya mo mali mu baamatuu kwaa Nziaambi, na biyuluu bia mo bili mu umonuu mu beni bangaa imiini. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Baana ba nguu, beni dimaaduku ifwaani kia mabuundu ma Nziaambi mali mu itinini kia Yuuda, mali mu usa imiini mu Yiisu Kristo. Beni diamoni pasi kwaa baata ba tsi a beni, weti bu mabuundu maa mamoni pasi kwaa Bayuudayo. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Bayuudayo baa, badusi Pfumu Yiisu na mibili, na bo bakwaamisi bisi. Nziaambi a ubaayaanga mu bo pe na bo bali mitaata mia baata boosi! <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Bo bali mu ukoonoso bisi uyiisi kwaa bifuumbu bikimi ndaa yiyituu uyobolo bo. Bo bali mu ubweese masumu makimi nha yulu a masumu ma bo bubaayiluu taanga dioosi. Ka nha tsieelele, kesi a Nziaambi yimaabwiilili bo.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli li na nzala ya ubwayamono libuundu la ku Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Baana ba nguu! Bisi dili diakabuu na beni mu mwaana taanga hoolo, mu musunyi ka a mu mutimi pe. Ka bisi dili na nzala yalaa ya ubwamono beni, na bisi diasi mifuri mialaa mu ukuusu nzala yii. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Bisi diali na nzala yalaa ya uyiri kwaa beni, na me Pawuli me nayesini uyiri kuu mbala dialaa. Ka Saatina akoonisi bisi uyiluu buu. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Mu ngwanya, ndila beni dili ilimbisi kia bisi, ka a muutu mukimi pe. Beni dili ilimbisi kia bisi, kinyi a bisi, na iburu kia mbiingili ki bisi dimono kinyi mu kio nha kulu a Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo nha nde akaayiri avutuu. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Mu ngwanya, beni dili buzitu na kinyi a bisi.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Nha tsieelele, bisi a diabwituu pe ukama mutimi mu ukebe. Bisi diaholi kesili ya udiaala bisi bake ku ngaanda ya Ateene. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Na diatsinduu beni Timoteo, mwaana a nguu a bisi. Nde li mbaayi a bisi wa isala kia Nziaambi, mu uyaabisa Ndaa Yimbwe ya Kristo. Bisi diayilii buu, paa nde ahamisa beni na uha beni ibaala mu imiini kia beni, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />paa muutu so mosi mu beni anyaala udee mundaa mbingisi di bisi dili mu umono. Beni bame diayiluu uyaaba ti, mbingisi di dili minhana mia Nziaambi mundaa bisi. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Mu ngwanya, nha bisi diali itwaari na beni, bisi diakwiyaabisi beni ti, sa babingisi bisi. Beni diayiluu uyaaba ti, maa ni mamayilimi. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ni mu buu, bu nali ka utuu pe ukutu mutimi mu ubaakebanga, me na tsindii beni Timoteo mu uholo mamvuungu ma imiini kia beni. Me na li na boomo ti Saatina a biti beni mu mapuusu; na isala kia bisi kia keni uba isali kia paamba.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ka mu taanga di, Timoteo maamata kwaa beni, na maa yaabisi bisi mamvuungu mamabwe ma imiini na litoono la beni. Nde maa yaabisa bisi ti, beni dili mu ubaalibilanga moonyi mu bisi mu litoono loosi, na beni dili na nzala yalaa ya ubwamono bisi, weti bu bisi ka dili na nzala yalaa ya ubwamono beni. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Ni mu buu baana ba nguu, kutso mangebe na mapasi ma bisi moosi, bisi diabayi pamini mundaa imiini kia beni. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Mu taanga di, bisi dili mu ubwamono kinyi, mundaa ti beni dili dianambata mu itwaari na Pfumu. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Mu ki iteesi bisi dituu uvutulu matoondo kwaa Nziaambi mundaa beni, mundaa kinyi yoosi yi beni diaha bisi nha kulu a nde? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Butsuu na nyanga, bisi dili mu uloombo kwaa Nziaambi mu mifuri, paa nde aha bisi muswa wa ubwamono beni mu mamono misi. Na paa ti, bisi dibweese bibili keni biahele mu imiini kia beni.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Nyaala Nziaambi nde makulu, Taayi a bisi, na Pfumu a bisi Yiisu, baha bisi kuulu ya uyiri kwaa beni! <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Nyaala ti Pfumu ayiluu ubwakulusu litoono li beni dili na lo bana mu bana, na mu baata boosi, mu ifwaani kia litoono li bisi dili na lo mu beni. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Nyaala nde ahamisa mitimi mia beni, paa beni diba baata bangiri, na baata bahele na bisieembi nha kulu a Nziaambi Taayi a bisi, na mutaanga di Pfumu a bisi Yiisu na baba ngiri ba nde boosi bakaa yiri avuutu. Ameni.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ndiaatili yili mu uha Nziaambi kinyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Baana ba nguu, beni diayii kwaa bisi buni beni dituu udiaata mu uha kinyi kwaa Nziaambi. Ngwanya, beni dili mu uyiluu buu. Ka mu taanga di, bisi dili mu uloombo na uhamisa beni mu kuumbu a Pfumu Yiisu mu uyiluu miabwavulu mii iteesi! <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Beni diayaaba mandoongi ma bisi diahi kwaa beni, mamati kwaa Pfumu Yiisu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Dimono litoono la Nziaambi ni lili ti: beni diba na ndiaatili yatsieeme na uhele uba kutso tsoongili. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Nyaala pasi muutu mu beni ayaaba ukuku nyutu a nde kutso tsieemini na buzitu, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />kwahele a uba ku tsini a litumu la manzala mamabi, weti buli mu usa bangooyi babahele uyaaba Nziaambi. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Mu ndaa yii, muutu so mosi pe wafwaana usa bubi kwaa mwaana a nguu a nde, so a buu pe, ukwaamisa nde. Bisi diakwiyaabisa beni ndaa yii, na bisi diayilii udutu beni matswi mu ndaa yii. Pfumu sa asieembe babuyiluu mandaa mamabi maa. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Nziaambi a ata bisi mbili pe mu udiaata kutso ma ndaa mviindi, ka mu udiaata kutso tsieemini. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Ni mu buu, muutu wu ubisi uyuu mandoongi ma, nde a abisi muutu pe, ka nde bisi Nziaambi wuli mu uha beni muheebili wa Ngiri.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Bisi a dili pe na nzala ya ubwasonuu beni mandaa mu yatala litoono mu bambaayi. Mundaa ti, Nziaambi nde makulu ayiisi beni litoono mu bambaayi. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Ni litoono me lii beni dili mu umweese kwaa baana ba nguu ba ku Masedwane. Ka, baana ba nguu, bisi dili mu uhamisa beni mu uyiluu miavulu mii. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Disa mifuri mu uba mu iyeenge. Ditala ndila mandaa ma beni bame, na disaa idiingi kia beni mu mioo mia beni bame, weti bu bisi diakwiyaabisa beni yo. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Ndiaatili a beni sa yisa ti bangooyi baha beni likiinzi, na beni a diba pe mufunu kwaa muutu so mosi.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nziriri a Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Baana ba nguu, bisi diatoono ti beni diyaaba ngwanya mu yatala baata babakwa, paa beni dinyaala umono ngebe weti baata babamosi, babahele na ilimbisi. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Bisi diasa imiini ti Yiisu akwi na nde asiimbii mu babakwa. Bumosi ka, bisi diasa ka imiini ti Nziaambi sa asiimbili, itwaari na Yiisu, boosi babakwa mu imiini mu nde.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Ngwanya, dimono mi bisi dili mu uyaabisa mu yatala nziisili a Pfumu: babakaaba moonyi nha kati a bisi mu taanga di Pfumu akaayiri, a bakaaba pe nha kulu a babakwa. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Mu taanga di dikaa yuu kele a muniingi a mukuutu a batumu ba Nziaambi, na kele a mvuramvuri a Nziaambi, Pfumu nde makulu sa a umata ku yula na sa a sutuu. Baata babakwa mu imiini mu Kristo sa baba batsiomi mu usiimbuu. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Tumake, bisi badiba moonyi mu taanga dii, sa badinaangila mu matuti itwaari na bo, mu ubwaanina na Pfumu, mu ingiee-ingiee. Mu yii, bisi sa dibaabaanganga itwaari na Pfumu. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Ni mu buu, dihamisina bana mu bana, mu nzisili yi.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Baana ba nguu, beni a dili na nzala pe ti basonuu beni mandaa, mu yatala taanga na nguungu yi maa moosi makaayira. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Mundaa ti beni bame diayiluu uyaaba ti, iluumbu kia Pfumu sa iyiri weti bu muyibi ubaayiri butsuu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24.43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luk 12.39</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2Pe 3.10</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Mu taanga di baata bakaaleele: «Bisi dili mutso iyeenge na izuunu», ni mu taanga dii, itsundatsundu, pfuuyili sa yibwa nha yulu a bo, weti bu mukaasa ngaa yimi ali mu ubaa misoongo. Muutu pe wu utuu uvuu!<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ka beni, baana ba nguu, beni a dili pe kutso pimisi, paa ti iluumbu kii iyabwiilili beni weti muyibi. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Mu ngwanya, beni boosi, beni dili baana ba liyalila, na ba nyanga. Bisi a dili so baana ba butsuu, so ba pimisi pe. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Ni mu buu, dinyaalani ula matolo weti babamosi. Ka dibaanani likanda na dikukani manyutu ma bisi. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Babubaala matolo, koo ula butsuu. Babubaakolo mala, koo ukolo ka butsuu. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Ka bisa beni badili baata ba nyanga, diafwaana ukuku manyutu ma bisi. Dilwaatanani imiini na litoono weti ikutu kia itali kili mu uswee tulu mu midiingi. Dilwaatani ilimbisi kia liyobolo weti iburu kia midiingi. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Mu ngwanya, Nziaambi a atoono pe ti bisi dimono kesi a nde, ka nde atoono ti bisi diholo liyobolo mu Pfumu Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Kristo akwi mu ndaa bisi, paa bisi diba moonyi itwaari na nde mu taanga di nde akaayira, so diaba tolo, so a buu pe, bamisii. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ni mu buu, dihamisina na dibaasila bana mu bana mu ukulu mu imiini, weti bu beni dili mu ukwasa.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tumini diatsielele na mabwee matsieelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Baana ba nguu, bisi diloombo kwaa beni mu ukiinzi babali mu usa isala kia mifuri nha kati a beni, babali mu ubiti na uha beni mandoongi mu tumini dia Pfumu. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Diha bo buzitu balaa na dimweese litoono mu bo, mundaa isala kia bo. Diba mu iyeenge nha kati a beni.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Baana ba nguu, bisi diloombo kwaa beni, mu usieembe babolo, dihamisa babali na boomo, dibaasila babahele na mifuri, dikama mitimi mu boosi. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Dikele muutu a vutulu mamabi mu mamabi pe, ka disaa taanga dioosi, mu uyiluu mamabwe nha kati a beni na kwaa baata boosi.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Dibaaba na kinya taanga dioosi. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Dibaakuundanga taanga dioosi. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Dikaavutulanga matoondo kwaa Nziaambi mu mandaa moosi. Maa ni mandaa ma Nziaambi ali mu uloombo kwaa beni, mu idiingi kia beni mu Yiisu Kristo.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />A didimisi pe Muheebili wa Ngira. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />A dimeengele pe mandaa mamata kwaa Nziaambi. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Ka dikengese mandaa moosi: diholo mamabwe, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />na dibisi mandaa moosi mamabi. <verse eid="1TH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Nyaala Nziaambi uli mu uha iyeenge, asa ti beni diba bangiri mu idiingi kia beni kioosi. Nyaala nde akebe imuutu kia beni kioosi, muheebili, muwuumu na manyutu a beni, diba biahele a bisieembi mu iluumbu kikaayiri Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Nde wuli mu uta beni mbili li ahama, ni nde kaa kuusu mandaa maa moosi.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Baana ba nguu, dikuundu ka mu bisi. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Dinyumbutusunu bana mu bana mu litoono, weti baana ba nguu bangaa Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Kolokolo a beni, mu kuumbu a Pfumu, ditaanga mukaanda wu kwaa baana ba nguu boosi. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Nyaala bweese ba Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo baba na beni!<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>